WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.672
A saved priority is explicit and reversible.

00:00:00.827 --> 00:00:01.831
Remove Must See while keeping the performance saved.

00:00:01.866 --> 00:00:02.876
Restore the priority with visible confirmation.

00:00:03.193 --> 00:00:04.396
Less crowded selects the 10-minute route and its landmarks.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.645
Step-free selects the 11-minute route; geometry changes with timing.

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.191
Save route confirms it is stored on this device.
